  "worked_solution": "The condition $x\\le 1$ implies that $x$ can be any value that is **less than or equal to ** $1.$\n\n To represent this on a number line:\n\n- We draw a **closed** circle at $x=1.$\n\n- Then, we draw an arrow starting from $1$ and going to the **left**.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14149933/assets/ace7c5f6f12ea43f2c857f77a8f2a27e29ee46bb0d8a40abb9ee7fe2804d088c.png)",
